1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,280
♪Beneath the mask♪

2
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,480
♪Lies another mask♪
(Original Story: Haishi Lisheng)

3
00:00:12,880 --> 00:00:15,320
♪Who's sincere♪

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:19,200
♪Who's only pretending♪

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,800
♪Borrowing your light♪

6
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:26,360
♪I walk through my own night♪

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,080
♪You are my weakness♪

8
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,720
♪And my weapon too♪

9
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,200
♪Draped in your shadow♪

10
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,200
♪I walk the blade's edge♪

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,880
♪If one day♪

12
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,640
♪The mask shatters♪

13
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,000
♪Will you still♪

14
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:42,480
♪Recognize my light♪

15
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,480
=The Masked Lover=

16
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:48,480
(Young Feng Yanyan)

17
00:00:50,719 --> 00:00:52,600
(I found out by chance.)

18
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,280
(That girl saved him)

19
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:55,840
(and stole buns for him.)

20
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,719
(But later,)

21
00:00:57,719 --> 00:00:59,799
(she mysteriously disappeared.)

22
00:01:00,479 --> 00:01:02,880
(When I went to see him that night,)

23
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:04,319
(he was about to sneak away.)

24
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:08,120
(Before leaving, he left her a ring,)

25
00:01:08,439 --> 00:01:10,280
(wrapped in the handkerchief
that held the buns.)

26
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,239
(So,)

27
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:14,640
(I stole the token he left behind.)

28
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:18,480
=Episode 15=

29
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,239
That girl and I were sold to
Yingchun Brothel around the same time.

30
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,239
But I never knew her name.

31
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,760
She was caught stealing buns that day.

32
00:01:26,760 --> 00:01:28,719
The matron beat her badly for it.

33
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:30,040
Then she disappeared.

34
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:31,920
I never saw her again.

35
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,400
So...

36
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:38,599
you watched someone else save him,

37
00:01:39,079 --> 00:01:40,920
then stole her token,

38
00:01:41,879 --> 00:01:43,159
and later,

39
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:46,079
when you met that idiot He Jingchen,

40
00:01:46,359 --> 00:01:49,560
you made him think you saved his life.

41
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,480
Why'd you take my stuff?

42
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,879
I'm returning it to its owner.

43
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,120
It was you.

44
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:09,159
You're that girl.

45
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,560
That's right.

46
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:13,199
And I'll tell you something else.

47
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,759
I didn't disappear that day.

48
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,960
I met the kindest person in the world.

49
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,719
Ow, ow!

50
00:02:35,719 --> 00:02:36,520
Where's the body?

51
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,240
I asked you, where's the body?

52
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:40,599
It hurts.

53
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:45,680
Where is the body?

54
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,159
I threw it in the river.

55
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:50,800
Su Yutang.

56
00:02:51,919 --> 00:02:53,960
Is this how you protect her
after promising me you would?

57
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,080
She tried to kill the governor!

58
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:57,919
Didn't I also promise you

59
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:59,759
I'd play Iron Leopard's
dutiful daughter?

60
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,159
Father ordered her drowned.

61
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,639
Was I supposed to disobey?

62
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,680
Look.

63
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:05,400
I even got hurt

64
00:03:05,599 --> 00:03:06,759
saving my dear father.

65
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:13,479
Even if you had to play
Iron Leopard's dutiful daughter,

66
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,240
you didn't have to hit a vital spot.

67
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,919
You're that good a shot.

68
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:17,639
Don't tell me

69
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:19,639
you couldn't aim anywhere but the heart.

70
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:26,080
He Jingchen.

71
00:03:26,639 --> 00:03:28,199
Are you going to kill me to avenge her?

72
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,680
Then do it.

73
00:03:33,199 --> 00:03:33,759
You...

74
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,439
Can't bring yourself to kill me?

75
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,080
He Jingchen.

76
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,039
Why exactly do you care
so much about her?

77
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:51,439
Because Feng Yanyan saved
Jingchen's life.

78
00:03:51,680 --> 00:03:52,759
Staff Officer Chen.

79
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,080
I know.

80
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,360
I just wanted to see

81
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:59,599
you lose it

82
00:03:59,919 --> 00:04:01,520
when you learned I'd killed your savior.

83
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,800
You're always so calm.

84
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,719
I didn't think you could
lose it like that.

85
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,800
Remember this?

86
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,079
This is what got me

87
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:20,240
wrongly accused of murder by the police.

88
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,480
You mean...

89
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:25,519
you shot Feng Yanyan
with this trick gun?

90
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,439
Of course.

91
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,120
I'm not like you.

92
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,560
You kill without batting an eye.

93
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,040
Where is she now?

94
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,720
I can't tell you that.

95
00:04:33,959 --> 00:04:34,800
Su Yutang.

96
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,720
Relax.

97
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,879
She's eating and sleeping just fine.

98
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:41,800
She's much better off
than she was in the back courtyard.

99
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,360
I'll keep her safe

100
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,480
as long as I'm safe.

101
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,480
So you're still threatening me.

102
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,560
Of course.

103
00:04:50,879 --> 00:04:52,800
I learned from Lu Shaoyun's fate.

104
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,720
Or I could die without knowing how.

105
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:57,079
All right, all right.

106
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,319
At least she got Feng Yanyan out
of the Governor's Residence.

107
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:01,600
And she did it by faking her death.

108
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:02,839
Now Feng Yanyan

109
00:05:02,879 --> 00:05:04,920
is free from Iron Leopard for good.

110
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:07,279
Isn't that what you've always wanted?

111
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,160
For that alone,

112
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,600
give her a break.

113
00:05:10,839 --> 00:05:13,839
I'm sure Ms. Lu will keep her word,
right?

114
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:15,480
Of course.

115
00:05:15,639 --> 00:05:17,360
Staff Officer Chen sees the big picture.

116
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,079
It hurts.

117
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:24,680
He Jingchen, what's wrong with you?

118
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,160
Do you have to get back at me like this?

119
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:31,000
I can't believe Staff Officer Chen
is one of your men too.

120
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:34,720
Just tell me.

121
00:05:35,160 --> 00:05:38,000
Who else at the Governor's Residence

122
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:40,120
or in the Lu Army works for you?

123
00:05:44,079 --> 00:05:44,879
By the way,

124
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,560
didn't you ask me last time

125
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:48,079
what else I wanted

126
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:49,600
besides money?

127
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,120
What else do you want?

128
00:05:55,319 --> 00:05:57,319
I want to become the Lu family's heir

129
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:59,160
and take over
the Lu Chamber of Commerce.

130
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,160
Who was it that said

131
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:05,000
once this was over,

132
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,199
you'd be the first to leave?

133
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:08,959
I changed my mind.

134
00:06:10,519 --> 00:06:11,319
He Jingchen.

135
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:13,279
No matter how capable you are,

136
00:06:13,279 --> 00:06:16,040
you can only control the Lu Army
and take the treasure map for yourself.

137
00:06:17,600 --> 00:06:18,959
You're not a Lu, after all.

138
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:22,040
The chamber could never officially
pass to you.

139
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,199
But I'm a Lu.

140
00:06:26,879 --> 00:06:28,040
As long as you keep quiet,

141
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,720
I'm the legal heir.

142
00:06:30,639 --> 00:06:31,680
He Jingchen.

143
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:33,800
We should keep it in the family.

144
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:37,279
So all your scheming

145
00:06:37,839 --> 00:06:39,800
wasn't just to avenge your friend.

146
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:44,040
You want wealth and status too.

147
00:06:46,959 --> 00:06:49,519
What's wrong with wanting wealth
and status?

148
00:06:50,399 --> 00:06:51,800
I suppose that's fine.

149
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:54,319
But

150
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,839
if anything happens to Feng Yanyan,

151
00:06:57,480 --> 00:07:00,079
I'll take you to the Lu clan patriarch.

152
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,279
If those old fossils learn
you're a fake,

153
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,920
you'll be the one drowned in the river.

154
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,120
He Jingchen.

155
00:07:20,319 --> 00:07:21,959
It's been so long.

156
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:23,560
How can you be so sure

157
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,879
Feng Yanyan was the one who saved you
when you were a child?

158
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,720
Of course. I have a token as proof.

159
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,800
She carries the ring
I gave her back then.

160
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:34,199
You mean this?

161
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:36,319
Give it to me.

162
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,680
Lady Feng is already with me.

163
00:07:40,240 --> 00:07:41,959
So I'll keep the token too.

164
00:07:43,879 --> 00:07:44,879
Wait.

165
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:56,800
I took this from Iron Leopard's waist.

166
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,360
Return it for me.

167
00:07:58,839 --> 00:08:01,240
Fire one round into the air first.

168
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:06,399
Now you know everything,

169
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:07,839
and I've given you the token back.

170
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:09,639
Can you let me go?

171
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:11,319
I still need to go find Jingchen.

172
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,480
Jingchen, Jingchen.

173
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:15,759
It's always He Jingchen with you.

174
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,040
Don't you ever get tired of it?

175
00:08:21,439 --> 00:08:23,399
I don't know what you see in him.

176
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,120
You're completely obsessed.

177
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,839
Jingchen is incredibly handsome.

178
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:31,839
He's thoughtful, gentle, and attentive.

179
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,600
He's got the looks

180
00:08:33,639 --> 00:08:35,039
and the build.

181
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,600
And when he puts on that uniform...

182
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,960
he's as manly as they come.

183
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:44,200
Don't you think that's a bit much?

184
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:47,039
Don't you like him too?

185
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,240
Now you can come clean with him.

186
00:08:49,399 --> 00:08:50,320
With this,

187
00:08:50,759 --> 00:08:52,559
he'll surely treat you differently now.

188
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:58,200
You think everyone's like you?

189
00:08:58,840 --> 00:09:00,399
I do want something from him,

190
00:09:01,039 --> 00:09:02,200
just not what you want from him.

191
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:06,759
She wasn't wrong about
you being handsome.

192
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,120
Right about what?

193
00:09:12,559 --> 00:09:13,679
Nothing.

194
00:09:14,799 --> 00:09:15,679
I'll return the gun.

195
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:16,160
Mm.

196
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:22,840
Thoughtful?

197
00:09:23,279 --> 00:09:25,000
He doesn't even know he's been fooled.

198
00:09:36,679 --> 00:09:38,000
Why are they chasing you?

199
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:40,039
They're all Lu Army men.

200
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:41,120
They're bad people.

201
00:09:43,039 --> 00:09:43,840
(He Jingchen.)

202
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,759
(Now you're wearing that uniform too.)

203
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,480
(Are you a bad guy too?)

204
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,879
(You said that when you were little,)

205
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,919
(but people change.)

206
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:57,080
(If you've changed,)

207
00:09:57,799 --> 00:09:59,759
(I'll never tell you who I am.)

208
00:10:01,440 --> 00:10:02,799
(But even if you haven't,)

209
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,480
(I still won't tell you.)

210
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:07,600
(I don't want you to treat me
the way you treat Feng Yanyan.)

211
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,000
(That's not what I want.)

212
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:43,320
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪

213
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:48,060
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

214
00:10:48,220 --> 00:10:50,480
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

215
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:53,800
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

216
00:10:53,860 --> 00:10:57,600
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

217
00:10:58,679 --> 00:10:59,840
He Jingchen.

218
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:03,320
Bad guy.

219
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,980
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

220
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:08,159
Idiot.

221
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,840
You can't tell right from wrong.

222
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:11,840
Kefu.

223
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,620
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

224
00:11:13,679 --> 00:11:15,159
I miss you so much.

225
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:19,399
I finally avenged you.

226
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:22,720
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

227
00:11:24,660 --> 00:11:27,880
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

228
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:31,440
Kefu, don't go.

229
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:34,320
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

230
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,039
Don't go.

231
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:42,399
Kefu,
when He Jingchen gets the treasure map,

232
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,600
will he become another Lu Zhentian?

233
00:11:46,799 --> 00:11:47,600
No.

234
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:48,460
Mm.

235
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:52,559
If you say he won't, then he won't.

236
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:22,200
♪A lie carved deep into the heart♪
(Loyalty Eternal)

237
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:26,840
♪Blades clash, leaving us both trapped♪

238
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:30,000
♪Nightmares from days gone by♪

239
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,520
♪Love and hate intertwine♪

240
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:36,880
♪In eyes ignited by sparks♪

241
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:42,840
♪Each blooming with a fierce edge♪

242
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,560
♪Shattering moonlight on the ground♪

243
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:51,040
♪I look up and meet your gaze♪

244
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,360
♪Unveiling all the absurdity♪

245
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:56,600
♪Seeking love's only truth♪

246
00:12:57,080 --> 00:13:03,280
♪Through fate's layered maze♪

247
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:06,880
♪Charging toward the unknown♪

248
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:10,080
♪Don't forget your stubborn heart♪

249
00:13:10,520 --> 00:13:16,600
♪Fire tempers the strength to go on♪

250
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:20,000
♪Counting down the long night's haze♪

251
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:23,320
♪With my own hands, I draw the dawn♪

252
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:26,160
♪Boundless♪
